  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial contribution to EvalNet Letter on Lessons for Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the EvalNet work on preparing a &#x201c;Letter on evaluation lessons of relevance for Ukraine&#x201d;, by collecting, condensing and presenting key lessons from earlier evaluations and studies. Lessons will be presented at the high-level meeting the high level meeting of the DAC on 15 November. The work is based on a call from the DAC Chair. This might be followed up by additional work to be defined at a later stage, possibly on the basis of the outcome of the DAC high level meeting.</narrative>
  </description>
